# Errors: bundles not numbered from 0; no such reset input.
# --slr-group-ports (v16kjGs 11-19: 16 x 512-bit write data crossed SLR1|SLR2
# unfolded): with SLR groups the bundles' output reads and queues and the
# request records' memories are built in the bundles' producers' group
# (Top_model, group 2), so only the record leaves it: the same MATCH in the
# same host cycles as without, group 2's module holds the ports_ memories,
# and its ports narrow (214 -> 133 bits; no mp_<k>_data link output).
